{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 41, :comments ["<b>And Esau hated Jacob because of the blessing.</b> One may say that <b>because of the blessing</b> does not refer to Jacob's blessing, but refers to Esau's blessing with which his father blessed him — על חרבך תחיה — in which he was confident. And this is what it says: <b>And Esau hated Jacob</b> because of the confidence in <b>the blessing</b> of 'על חרבך תחיה' etc." "<b>The days of mourning for my father draw near.</b> And he will no longer beget a son who would take vengeance for Jacob my brother." "<b>And I will kill him.</b> The vav with shva and the alef with patach."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:06:22.406258205Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}